  "description": "(3.2.0) Plugin host + marketplace + lifecycle for the CircleAI substrate. Direct lift from CircleUp's plugin system — vault-specific events stripped, replaced with a generic string-keyed event bus. Per-plugin AssemblyLoadContext (collectible) lets two plugins ship conflicting dep versions. Declarative permissions are gated by a PermissionedPluginContext wrapper, mirroring the CircleUp UX where users review what a plugin asked for before granting.",
